    "blurb": "Safe. Transparent. Reliable. Future-ready Migration.",
    "overview": "Seamlessly migrate from Camunda 7 to Camunda 8 with Integrity Vision. We deliver secure, low-risk transitions with expert support, architecture alignment, API adaptation, and historical data migration — tailored for your business needs.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
