  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Seamless Migration to Camunda 8 — Structured, Secure, Predictable.",
    "splashDescription": "Seamless, structured, and stress-free — that’s how Integrity Vision approaches the migration to Camunda 8. We support all Camunda 7 deployment scenarios and transition them to modern Camunda 8 environments — whether Kubernetes-based or virtualized. Our migration service covers everything from architecture and process audits to custom code transformation, API alignment, historical data migration, and post-migration integration with your BI/reporting stack.\n\nWith flexible delivery models — fixed-price or T&M ways, turnkey or collaborative — we ensure you stay in control. Whether you need a step-by-step transition or a single-cutover strategy, our experts provide the safest and most efficient path forward. You get a future-ready process platform with minimal risk and maximum business continuity.",
